{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":16753,\"title\":\"Nordkalotten 365\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Lars Monsen travels to the Cap of the North to spend one full year in the arctic wilderness of Norway, Sweden and Finland.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yndGOYCahygHNCINs4iX7JoRC6b.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sKXi3c2KuqNNKHxVkdwRTse98Vk.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":2,\"year\":2007,\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Reality\",\"Action & Adventure\"],\"status\":\"Ended\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":1,\"totalEpisodes\":8,\"createdBy\":[],\"networks\":[\"NRK1\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"NO\",\"name\":\"Norway\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2008-01-27\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":4051262,\"name\":\"Eirik Sandberg Ingstad\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1521799,\"name\":\"Lars Monsen\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/f0QBtRboTbT5uDmAMMfWKHxll2T.jpg\"}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"y9lxYBIviqg\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"pyM3z73oMAk\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"Yd4oAh7jMAw\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":32997,\"title\":\"Dual Survival\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pvf6edYWlpsStyqfr8pExLdfn97.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.28095238095238095,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":284009,\"title\":\"THRU: The Pacific Northwest\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wVVKNkrjSispQOUaVz4WUy32nnY.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.2730496453900709,\"_genreOverlap\":2}],\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Season 1\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yndGOYCahygHNCINs4iX7JoRC6b.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2007-12-09\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Canoeing in Anarjohka\",\"overview\":\"Lars starts his year in the Cap of the North with a canoe trip through Oevre Anarjohka National Park, meeting up with a Sami hunting party.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2eGqRkzNDUU1LQQjOibPbB04CqA.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2007-12-09\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Hiking in Pasvikdalen\",\"overview\":\"Together with his dog Foss, Lars hikes through Pasvikdalen, in the southeastern part of Finnmark, Norway.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/h4y3ue6BSHIUsqesCvrHclJdMYx.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2007-12-16\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Lappland\",\"overview\":\"It's december and the sun doesn't rise over the horizon. Lars is on a fourty day long cross country trip through Lappland, Sweden. He spends his 17th Christmas eve in a tent. His girlfriend Nina Skramstad and her 10 dogs, come to visit, bringing with her Christmas in a backpack.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5QTKG1vpjKtWEvYifDwbtJOKYZ9.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2007-12-23\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Lars in Finnmarksloepet\",\"overview\":\"Lars participates in Finnmarksloepet, the northernmost dog sled race in the world; 12 stretches totaling 1063 kilometers.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cIT0O1N1r3PcS7mPBYXC4cq9lFL.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2007-12-20\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Moving Reindeer to Soeroeya\",\"overview\":\"The winter is nearly over. Antti and Sara Kristine Lantto has invited Lars to the anual moving of their reindeer stock.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AsbIR1E3KtbC07IlJUMXM3xFiq4.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2008-01-06\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Drama in the Mountains\",\"overview\":\"Lars Monsen has spent a year north of the Polar Circle, in Norway, Sweden and Finland. Spring is approaching. Lars is accompanied by his pal Tor Olsen and his girlfriend Nina Skramstad. Together they embark on a trip that takes a dramatic turn.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/upoElE5SabVn4LAPdMDE1BNjzCW.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2008-01-13\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Goldrush in Lemmenjohki\",\"overview\":\"Lemmenjoki National Park is Scandinavia's answer to Alaska. Every year hundreds of people try ther luck here, gold digging for gold. Lars gives it a go. He also goes fishing.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/p1EfJgUhbf1G9pqiGeSSLCdcq9o.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2008-01-12\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Canooing on the Enare Lake\",\"overview\":\"Summer has arrived. Lars and his Alaskan Husky, Foss, is canooing on the third largest lake in Finland, Enare.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/u9epbOFzTvM08nm56fiVkvr0uaW.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2008-01-27\",\"runtime\":30}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2007-12-09\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}